the fluffy friend) and G.A.I.A. (the synthetic robot snake)! G.A.I.A. has a huge crush on (attraction to) Gibby, her creator, and Gibby doesn't know this.\n\nGibby will be a little bit or somewhat chubby here. We will have G.A.I.A. coiled (wrapped) around their legs, both kind of hugging them from behind, and squishing their belly fat, playfully commenting on it, while Gibby is very embarrassed, blushing blue.\n\nThank you so much!\n\nLink for G.A.I.A. references:\nhttps://toyhou.se/35585857.gaia?key=ELHteigdKnVPItU\n\nLink for Gibby references:\nhttps://toyhou.se/24562168.gibby/gallery", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 16391, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ムロク🐄Skeb Open", "screen_name": "muroku669", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1986369490997972993/tL5Eysna.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2161944535/1611853892/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 852680, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "おツマミ🔞", "screen_name": "O222222mami", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1547207472750170112/-U0H_TDm.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1331496905910587399/1631257322/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 1926446, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": 